.TH AD_LAYER_PACE 1 "2026-08-30" "ad 2.0" "ad layers"
.SH NAME
ad_layer_pace \- insert delay ops between ops (controls animation speed)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ad_layer_pace
.RI [ options ]
< post_ops > timed_ops
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ad_layer_pace
reads post-processed V2 TSV from stdin, inserts
.B delay
lines between ops, and writes timed V2 TSV to stdout. The animator reads this timed stream and applies delays between ops to control animation speed.
.PP
Delay types:
.RS
.IP \(bu 3
char \(em per-character delay (insert/delete)
.IP \(bu 3
word \(em pause after words
.IP \(bu 3
hunk \(em pause between hunks
.IP \(bu 3
awd_slow / awd_fast / awd_skip \(em adaptive word delete phases
.IP \(bu 3
accel_delete \(em accelerated multi-line deletion
.IP \(bu 3
block_start / block_end \(em pause before/after large block deletes
.IP \(bu 3
pause_after \(em periodic pause after N changed lines
.RE
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-delete\-pacing  MODE
Deletion strategy. Default: word.
.RS
.IP \(bu 3
char \(em one char at a time
.IP \(bu 3
word \(em group consecutive char deletes on same line
.IP \(bu 3
instant \(em no delay between deletes
.IP \(bu 3
rapid-eol \(em accelerate trailing char deletes
.IP \(bu 3
rapid-identical \(em accelerate runs of same char
.IP \(bu 3
accel \(em accelerated multi-line deletion
.IP \(bu 3
flash \(em highlight whole line, pause, delete in one shot
.RE
.TP
.BI \-\-insert\-pacing  MODE
Insertion strategy. Default: char.
.RS
.IP \(bu 3
char \(em one char at a time
.IP \(bu 3
word \(em type words instantly, pause after each word
.IP \(bu 3
accel \(em accelerated word typing
.RE
.TP
.BI \-\-delete\-speed  SPEED
Delete speed multiplier: slow, normal, fast, instant. Default: normal.
.TP
.BI \-\-insert\-speed  SPEED
Insert speed: slow, normal, fast. Default: normal.
.TP
.BI \-\-delete\-threshold  N
Min chars to trigger rapid/word modes. Default: 3.
.TP
.BI \-\-pacing  MODE
Timing mode: uniform, adaptive, gaussian, review. Default: uniform.
.TP
.BI \-\-gaussian\-jitter\-pct  N
Jitter percentage for gaussian mode. Default: 20.
.TP
.BI \-\-pause\-after\-lines  N
Pause every N changed lines (for large hunks). Default: 0 (disabled).
.TP
.BI \-\-pause\-after\-threshold  N
Only pause if total ops > N. Default: 50.
.TP
.BI \-\-pause\-after\-ms  N
Pause duration in ms. Default: 500.
.TP
.B \-\-accel\-delete
Enable accelerated multi-line deletion.
.TP
.BI \-\-accel\-delete\-start\-ms  N
Starting delay for accel delete. Default: 80.
.TP
.BI \-\-accel\-delete\-min\-ms  N
Minimum delay for accel delete. Default: 15.
.TP
.BI \-\-accel\-delete\-accel  N
Acceleration factor (0-100). Default: 85.
.TP
.BI \-\-block\-delete\-size  N
Block size for grouped deletes. Default: 3.
.TP
.BI \-\-pause\-before\-delete\-ms  N
Pause before large block deletes. Default: 200.
.TP
.BI \-\-pause\-after\-delete\-ms  N
Pause after large block deletes. Default: 200.
.TP
.BI \-\-flash\-pause\-ms  N
Pause for flash mode. Default: 400.
.TP
.BI \-\-flash\-highlight\-ms  N
Highlight duration for flash mode. Default: 300.
.TP
.BI \-\-cursor\-glide\-ms  N
Cursor glide duration. Default: 0 (disabled).
.TP
.B \-\-cursor\-glide\-show\-intermediate
Show intermediate cursor positions during glide. Default: 1.
.TP
.BI \-\-distance\-speed  MODE
Distance-based speed: adaptive, off. Default: off.
.TP
.BI \-\-distance\-threshold  N
Distance threshold for adaptive speed. Default: 5.
.TP
.BI \-\-distance\-fast\-mult  N
Fast multiplier for adaptive speed. Default: 2.0.
.TP
.BI \-\-distance\-slow\-mult  N
Slow multiplier for adaptive speed. Default: 0.5.
.TP
.B \-\-help, \-h
Show help and exit.
.SH INPUT/OUTPUT
V2 TSV format. Input should be post-processed (reorder + optional layers).
.SH CONFIGURATION
No environment variables. Use CLI flags or the config file at
$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/ad/config.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B ad_layer_pace --delete-pacing word --insert-pacing char < post.txt > timed.txt
Word-delete pacing, char-insert pacing.
.TP
.B ad_layer_pace --pacing gaussian --gaussian-jitter-pct 30 < post.txt > timed.txt
Gaussian jitter for human-like typing.
.TP
.B ad_layer_pace --accel-delete < post.txt > timed.txt
Accelerated multi-line deletion.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ad_postprocess (1),
.BR ad_layer_reorder (1),
.BR ad (1)
.PP
.I docs/src/plugin-layers.md
